2|0@dbz^1440133648#cuacw8e:Unclehouse2$:My problem is that in essentially every single major battle (Frieza, Cell, And Majin Buu) he has been "gifted" with a quick way to power up. In Frieza's saga, Elder Guru or whatever unlocked his potential by merely touching him. In Cell's saga, while it definitely does not come easy, he is granted a convenient power up. I love the Cell saga and that transformation, but for the sake of my argument, I added it. And Finally, in the Majin Buu saga, the wise and powerful Old Kai points his arms and Gohan for whatever amount of time and is magically gifted with powers greater than SS3 when he could barely become SS2 beforehand. While I do kind of dislike the direction that Gohan is going down, your points are pretty good and I've changed my mind somewhat on his character. I just can't bare to see Gohan get another convenient "Unlocking of his potential" bullshit that was basically seeded throughout the entirety of DBZ. So I can be somewhat pleased if they keep him where he's at if they develop Goten and Trunks more in the warriors that we all want them to be and not the dumb shits they became in GT.
